"The wooden statue that wept in a convent chapel in Japan": "La statue de bois qui pleura dans la chapelle d’un couvent au Japon",
"Akita at Night": "Akita la nuit",
"A snowy winter night in northern Japan": "Une nuit d’hiver enneigée dans le nord du Japon",
"Zarvanytsia": "Zarvanytsia",
"The wonder-working icon by the spring, beloved of Ukrainian Greek Catholics": "L’icône miraculeuse près de la source, chère aux gréco-catholiques ukrainiens",
"Zarvanytsia by Candlelight": "Zarvanytsia aux chandelles",
"The pilgrims’ night vigil at the holy spring": "La veillée nocturne des pèlerins à la source sainte",
"Sanctify Wine": "Bordeaux Sanctify",
"The colors of the Sanctify emblem: white on deep wine": "Les couleurs de l’emblème de Sanctify : blanc sur bordeaux profond",
"Lock": "Verrouiller",
"Reason": "Motif",
"post {n}": "message {n}",
