"Sts. Francis Xavier, Peter Canisius, Robert Bellarmine, Aloysius Gonzaga, Isaac Jogues, Peter Claver": "Saint François Xavier, saint Pierre Canisius, saint Robert Bellarmin, saint Louis de Gonzague, saint Isaac Jogues, saint Pierre Claver",
