"Sts. Alphonsus Liguori, Gerard Majella, John Neumann, Clement Mary Hofbauer; Bls. Zenon Kovalyk, Mykola Charnetskyi": "Saint Alphonse de Liguori, saint Gérard Majella, saint Jean Neumann, saint Clément-Marie Hofbauer ; bienheureux Zénon Kovalyk, Mykola Tcharnetsky",
